\date{2026-11-02T01:50:17Z}
\title{Subobject}
\taxon{Definition}
\author{hsuchingchung}
\import{macros-subobj}

\p{

The \strong{subobjects} on an object #{A} in a category \CCat are the equivalence classes of [monomorphisms](0006) into #{A} quotiented by the [subobject equivalence relation](0009) #{\sim}, denoted by \SubA. In notation:

##{\SubA := \set{ u | u : U \hook V }/{\sim}.}

}
